# Production build values for the Grow Farms website.
#
# Vite loads this file automatically for `npm run build` and it wins over .env,
# so a build can no longer pick up the localhost value sitting in .env and ship
# a bundle that calls http://localhost:5000 from the visitor's browser.
#
# The value is deliberately relative. The API is served from the same domain as
# the site (https://growfarm-fullstack.dvworks.in/api), so "/api" resolves
# against whatever origin the page was loaded from: the same bundle works on the
# live domain, on a staging copy and behind any future domain change, and no
# request is ever cross-origin, so CORS never enters into it.
VITE_API_URL=/api
